      "id": "nt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 706,
      "width": 1369.0,
      "height": 40.0,
      "text": "Note: The dashed rectangles are trust boundaries. Only the public zone is reachable directly from the internet; the private subnet is not.\nApp servers hold no state, so scaling means adding instances; sessions live in the cache and data in the database.",
